Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.82,0:00:25.34,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is a story of long, long ago,\Nbefore our world was formed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.27,0:00:29.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,From the age of the Ancient Gods.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.86,0:00:38.00,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Lord of the Heavens, Ame-no-Minakanushi,\Ncalled forth Izanagi and Izanami. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ame-no-Minakanushi, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Izanagi, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Izanami}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.52,0:00:45.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He bade them to create a world\Nwhere people could live and be happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.26,0:00:57.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Izanagi and Izanami, from atop the Floating Bridge of Heaven, \Nstirred up the world below with a large spear.  {Ame-no-ukihashi (天浮橋) - Floating Bridge of Heaven - apparently a thing}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.14,0:01:07.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,As they withdrew the spear, \Na drop fell from its tip and formed many islands.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your worst! {fuck me, the audio gets worse with each one of those movies} {accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Susanoo! {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Susanoo-no-Mikoto - gonna go with long vowels and original forms of everyone's names because I think they contribute to the mystic and otherworldly atmosphere of ancient japan}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro! Stop picking on the weak!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.86,0:04:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?! Why, you...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.80,0:05:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me! {????} {だれだこら？shouldn't be too plot relevant otherwise}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.17,0:05:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! And that! How about this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.33,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My head... Forgive me! {?????} {probably 頭が…許してくれ}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that? Had enough?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.09,0:05:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Mother!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.61,0:05:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not act violently.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.24,0:05:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro is sorry, so you must forgive him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.79,0:05:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a boy needs more than a strong body.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy must also have a gentle heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.07,0:05:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's wash you. Then we'll go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.83,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Daddy! Get him!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.08,0:07:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.02,0:07:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! {?}{likely あ痛！ or just grunts}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Who's next?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.69,0:07:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be your opponent.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.79,0:07:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, sure. \NCome on, give it your best.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.82,0:07:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can fight you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.81,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, give it your best.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know... \NI clearly can't compare to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.97,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Taro, want to fight me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.07,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? N-No, I'm good.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.04,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boy! No need to be shy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.71,0:07:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean, "passed away"? {okakure ni natta}{I can't really think of a good example right now, but I'd recommend using different words to show distinction between this line and line 58, not just lump it in one 'passed away', as okakure ni natta is reserved for someone with a high status}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Taro might know!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.66,0:08:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.29,0:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened to Mom, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.55,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.94,0:08:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo-kun, quiet down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, what happened to Mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.69,0:09:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She passed on. {onakunari ni natta - not exactly "okakure ni natta" but also pretty highbrow language}{see note in line 49}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.20,0:09:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Passed on? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.71,0:09:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It means...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She has gone to the Land of the Dead. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yomi}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.43,0:09:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother must have been sad to go too.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.12,0:09:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving your father \Nand her beloved Susanoo and going all alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.68,0:09:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But it couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The time had come for her to leave. {lit: the [death's] messenger has come to pick her up}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.48,0:09:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she didn't want to, \Nshe had no choice but to go alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she didn't want to? \NSo Mom didn't want to go?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll go bring her back.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.34,0:09:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't do that, Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.99,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.20,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a question of "why?"
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You just can't.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.23,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave it at that. {lit: Don't say things you don't understand.}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.22,0:09:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm going! I'm going to where Mom is!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.33,0:10:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never allow that!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.48,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.91,0:10:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, what are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.59,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.78,0:11:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.05,0:11:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.79,0:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.45,0:11:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.42,0:12:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not right for a boy to cry like that, Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.65,0:12:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mom, you left me behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.12,0:12:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.22,0:12:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't take you with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.47,0:13:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaving me behind is so mean!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.77,0:13:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo, my son. {hey just sounds too...casual?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.82,0:13:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you must live strongly,\N by your own power.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.70,0:13:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom will always be watching you \Nfrom a faraway land.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.54,0:13:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of place is the land where Mom went?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.09,0:13:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a land... that's peaceful...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.39,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,tranquil... and beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A land of happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.48,0:13:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... I want to go there too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.69,0:13:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is it? Is it across the sea?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.36,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, across the sea. Your mother's land, \Nthe land of happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.03,0:14:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I get there? Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.50,0:14:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But... even if you try, \Nit's not a place you can easily reach.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.43,0:14:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.51,0:15:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you wised up?!{was "Have you come to your senses?!", but way too high CPS}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.22,0:15:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What on Earth were you thinking?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go to Mom's land.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.53,0:15:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't swim there.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you couldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do something so reckless ever again!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.82,0:15:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, give me a boat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a boat?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.69,0:15:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.98,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A boat?! What are you going to do with it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.31,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to Mom's land, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.22,0:15:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Susanoo?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.34,0:15:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm building a boat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.08,0:15:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A boat?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm going to ride this across the sea.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.86,0:15:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.10,0:15:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.45,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And me!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.68,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.64,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me! Well, isn't that impressive!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.99,0:15:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Across the sea...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.82,0:16:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.97,0:16:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To Mom's land, where my mother is.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.74,0:16:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's... Mom's land?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.99,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. First we'll go to the Dominion of the Night \Nto meet my big brother Tsukuyomi, {According to the Kojiki when Izanagi tasked his children to rule over the various realms: Amaterasu got the "Plain of the High Heaven" (Takamagahara), Tsukuyomi got the "Dominion of the Night" (Yoru-no-wosu-kuni), and Susanoo got the "Sea Plain" (海原, Una-bara). Susanoo ignored this command and kept crying over the loss of his dead mother Izanami, such that his weeping led to death and destruction. As Susanoo wished, Izanagi expelled him to be near his mother in Ne-no-kata-su-kuni.[3] In the previous episodes about Izanami's death this land is called Yomi.}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.42,0:16:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll go to the Plain of the High Heaven\Nto say goodbye to my sister Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.07,0:16:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, while asking for directions, \Nwe'll head steadily east until we reach where Mom is.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass on this one.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.60,0:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Me too, I'd rather pass...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Akahana, you're coming, right? {rabbit's name; means "red flower"}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.14,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! I'm going! You bet I'm going!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.89,0:17:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,O Moon, please watch over our journey.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.74,0:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, take care!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.60,0:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Akahana! Be careful on your way! Akahana!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.59,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Good... Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.26,0:17:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.88,0:17:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.22,0:17:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat my carrot!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.39,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.72,0:18:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.96,Thought,,0,0,0,,What a handful of a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.74,0:18:19.17,Thought,,0,0,0,,Chase your dreams and go as far as you can.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.18,0:18:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Susanoo, where is that Dominion of the Night?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.20,0:18:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it's to the east, but I don't really know either.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.28,0:18:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a lot to go on. We're done for.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.83,0:20:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Attaboy! Show him one more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.36,0:21:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo! Did he get you?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.84,0:21:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.62,0:21:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get the boat back in shape.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, magnificent, magnificent.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.61,0:21:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That fish is called Akuru, you know. {https://yokai.com/akuru/}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.38,0:21:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a real thug. \NWe've all been fed up with him for a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let me help.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.10,0:22:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.10,0:22:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm the one who governs this sea, Wadatsumi. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Watatsumi - also susanoo's brother} {おさめる here would be ruling/governing rather than calming}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.15,0:22:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.22,0:22:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... do you know where \Nthe Dominion of the Night is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.32,0:22:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I do. You want to go there?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. As thanks \Nfor bringing peace to this sea,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.41,0:22:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll guide you.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:33.14,0:22:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dominion of the Night lies even deeper \Nthan the bottom of this sea. It's deep underground. {lit: bottom of the earth}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's rude! {???}{accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.40,0:22:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This cave is the Portal of Dreams. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yomotsu_Hirasaka - here instead of yomi/yomotsu it's yume no = "of dreams"; dubtitles just went "Crystal Cave"}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.77,0:23:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the entryway to the Dominion of the Night.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.18,0:23:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.22,0:23:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.37,0:23:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dominion of the Night!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.53,0:24:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.11,0:24:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here, brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.68,0:24:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.13,0:24:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-This is terrible! Terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:51.55,0:24:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.11,0:24:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:55.43,0:24:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:57.68,0:24:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Lord Susanoo... {-sama}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:59.35,0:25:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of sorry state are you in?!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.37,0:25:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... yes. I fought back bravely, \Nbut in the end, I couldn't do anything to...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:07.68,0:25:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A large army!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.82,0:25:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A large army, you say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.93,0:25:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:13.20,0:25:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo is still a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:33.64,0:25:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go meet him. {??}{this can go both 行ってみなさい(ordering to go) or 言ってみなさい(order to speak), went with former considering context}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.24,0:25:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo wouldn't have a reason to attack me.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:39.56,0:25:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, Lord Tsukuyomi.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.49,0:25:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo, though still a child, \Npossesses tremendous power.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.99,0:25:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot ever feel at ease.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.19,0:25:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in case, please lend us the ice mirror. {?}{accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.82,0:26:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lonely and eerie country.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:04.39,0:26:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.13,0:26:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, won't you open the gate?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:14.06,0:26:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to see my brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:15.61,0:26:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you hidden your army, Lord Susanoo?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:19.50,0:26:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Army? I don't have anything like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.66,0:26:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a conspiracy. He's planning a surprise attack. \NDon't let your guard down!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.78,0:26:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.44,0:26:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I bring an army?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.74,0:26:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you say, I won't fall for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.49,0:26:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a veteran of many battles,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.30,0:26:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,a true warrior hardened by countless fights!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:40.53,0:26:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You stubborn fool!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:57.31,0:27:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice mirror, lend me your power!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.06,0:27:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo! Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:21.12,0:27:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's gotten so cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:28.86,0:27:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:30.22,0:27:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean, so mean!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:32.07,0:27:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Freezing your own little brother like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:36.26,0:27:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It was to stop his rampage.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:39.43,0:27:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.13,0:28:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you freeze me!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.62,0:29:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaklings, the lot of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:16.82,0:29:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:19.61,0:29:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:22.17,0:29:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To go to Mom's land.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:24.04,0:29:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's land?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:25.22,0:29:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:26.10,0:29:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where Mom is.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:28.00,0:29:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where it is, brother?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.69,0:29:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where Mom is?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:32.40,0:29:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, of course... {??? think he was about to say "Well, everyone knows that"} {more or less, yes. the idea is he obviously knows where she is, but decided not to speak}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:35.38,0:29:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.47,0:29:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know of no such land.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:39.08,0:29:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't? It's a wonderfully peaceful, \Nbeautiful land of happiness. {??} {accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:43.90,0:29:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it... might be so.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.35,0:29:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not a place you can go.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:50.65,0:29:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:52.24,0:29:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up and go back to Father.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:55.36,0:29:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying you don't want to see Mom anymore? \NThat you're fine living without her?!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:59.36,0:30:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that! {/not fine}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:02.49,0:30:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it either, but it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:05.66,0:30:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't love our mother, that's it!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:08.00,0:30:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ask you for anything anymore!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:10.83,0:30:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo, wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.13,0:30:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:23.76,0:30:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:34.11,0:30:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever run into trouble, use this.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:39.95,0:30:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You mustn't, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:42.52,0:30:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the precious Ice Orb!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:45.46,0:30:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:48.62,0:30:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of Susanoo for me... Akahana.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:06.78,0:31:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Susanoo. Let's go back.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:10.50,0:31:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Cheer up.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.44,0:31:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want something to eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:48.06,0:31:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that was scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.14,0:31:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to go out now.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:53.02,0:31:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.60,0:32:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:04.97,0:32:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, please. I live in this Land of Fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:09.78,0:32:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Titanbo. {タイタン坊; "Big Tombo" in dubtitles}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:14.32,0:32:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The rivers have completely dried up, and it never rains. \NIt's all because of the God of Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.61,0:32:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The God of Fire?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:32.35,0:32:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, God of Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:36.94,0:32:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, God of Fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:40.11,0:32:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out! I want to talk to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:51.16,0:32:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:54.12,0:32:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Susanoo, son of Izanagi and Izanami.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:57.56,0:33:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good that you're giving warmth to this land, \Nbut it's gotten too warm!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:02.00,0:33:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is suffering! Can't you stop it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:05.42,0:33:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:07.04,0:33:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you're the son of Izanagi and Izanami?! \NHow insolent!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:11.57,0:33:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home at once!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.22,0:33:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll burn you to death!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.76,0:33:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to mock my father and mother?!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:17.64,0:33:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:22.90,0:33:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to oppose me, little brat?! {??}{小僧め、来るか？！}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:01.52,0:34:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:34:09.41,0:34:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:27.05,0:34:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... not really into... that kind of... {???? / I don't like where this is going}{僕は…ああいうのあんまり…好きじゃないんだよ}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:16.03,0:36:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:30.92,0:36:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow, it burns!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:32.80,0:36:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.81,0:37:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that? Are you impressed?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:02.74,0:37:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.52,0:37:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I had this!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:20.53,0:37:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:24.30,0:37:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's Tsukuyomi's! {/my brother's}
Dialogue: 10,0:37:27.40,0:37:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Tsukuyomi, please grant us \Nthe power to defeat the God of Fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:39.04,0:37:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:28.71,0:38:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:31.54,0:38:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:32.80,0:38:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to you, the God of Fire has been defeated!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:36.57,0:38:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:39.00,0:38:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's set off. \NWe have to get to the Plain of the High Heaven quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:43.40,0:38:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo, I have a request.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:46.02,0:38:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:49.55,0:38:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:50.54,0:38:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 10,0:38:51.89,0:38:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,this land is poor and cramped. {lit: the earth is bad and few}
Dialogue: 10,0:38:55.56,0:39:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to find a rich land where everyone can live.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:00.63,0:39:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:01.51,0:39:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Titanbo, I'll have you know that \NI'm Lord Susanoo's number one follower.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:07.69,0:39:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I'm your senior. Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:11.91,0:39:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:39:15.25,0:39:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:19.30,0:39:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As a token of my apology, \NI'll give you the Heavenly Bird Boat! {天鳥船神（あめのとりふねのかみ）、 - it's a god in its own right; yes, same as in utsunomiko}
Dialogue: 10,0:39:25.63,0:39:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please ride it on your journey!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:22.11,0:40:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's the Plain of the High Heaven!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:38.74,0:40:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's beautiful!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:01.48,0:41:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Susanoo, beyond this river \Nmust be Lady Amaterasu's palace, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:09.41,0:41:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:11.39,0:41:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do you have \Nin the Plain of the High Heaven?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:27.43,0:41:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:30.05,0:41:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:32.64,0:41:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Susanoo?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:39.40,0:41:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, do you know the peaceful, \Nbeautiful land of happiness where Mom is?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:45.80,0:41:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.67,0:41:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, Susanoo,
Dialogue: 10,0:41:50.03,0:41:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,would you like to work in this plain?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:54.08,0:41:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:55.85,0:41:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to go to Mom's land.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:58.91,0:42:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:01.38,0:42:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Susanoo, there is plenty of land here.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:06.51,0:42:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you cleared it, the people \Nof the Land of Fire could live there.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:20.52,0:42:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And anyway... why do I have \Nto do something like this for Titanbo?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:30.78,0:42:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:34.92,0:42:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Let's use the horses too.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:38.08,0:42:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can just take them like that? {without asking}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:41.08,0:42:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:42.09,0:42:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing this for {\i1}you{\i0}, remember? Help us out!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:46.13,0:42:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come over here, horsie...{accurate, last few are just random grunts}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:49.64,0:42:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch. Hey, you idiot! Make fun of me, \Nand you'll learn how scary I can be!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:53.09,0:42:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:06.02,0:43:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:09.60,0:43:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody... {ねえ…（助けてよ）but cut midway with a scream/grunt}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:12.20,0:43:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:43:13.18,0:43:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:18.26,0:43:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody do something! {ねえ、なんとかして！}{fun fact(?) this is probably referring to when Susanoo flayed a horse, the Ame-no-Fuchikoma and threw it into Amaterasu's weaving hall}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:21.29,0:43:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:30.19,0:43:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:51.15,0:43:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this once, please forgive him.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:54.09,0:43:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought the child would do something like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:02.62,0:44:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's use the water from this river to make more fields.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:05.96,0:44:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we can do something like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.67,0:44:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't run out. We only need a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.18,0:44:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have to be this stingy. They have plenty!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:16.13,0:44:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They broke the levee? {ridge of earth between rice fields​; usually called bund in SE Asia}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:20.27,0:44:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:22.87,0:44:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have a stern talk with Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.71,0:44:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But the child didn't know any better.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:29.91,0:44:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably thought it would make the fields wider.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:37.79,0:44:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't use the water from the fields,\N it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:40.89,0:44:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's draw water from this river.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:04.73,0:45:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! It's done!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:10.71,0:45:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:33.18,0:45:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is absolutely outrageous! {????}{まったくもってけしくりからん！}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:36.38,0:45:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But... we never meant to flood the fields!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:40.55,0:45:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? \NNot just our fields, everything is in chaos! {???}{畑もなにもめちゃくちゃだ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:43.30,0:45:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have welcomed you, but this is too much! {/silently - w/e he means}{黙ってりゃいい気になって}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:46.12,0:45:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only here to cause trouble! {??? maybe he means "obviously, he is here to ruin us"}{more or less, yes}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:47.68,0:45:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bad child.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:50.27,0:45:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it now! He's scheming \Nto take over the Plain of the High Heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:53.81,0:45:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:56.11,0:45:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There, see?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:56.11,0:45:58.11,Overlap,,0,0,0,,There! That's his true nature! {正体を表したな？！}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:58.11,0:45:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize him!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:58.86,0:46:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He must leave this land! {???}{追い出してしまえ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:00.95,0:46:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hands to yourself! {/don't be violent}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:03.84,0:46:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Step back! {??}{accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:05.40,0:46:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:06.54,0:46:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay a hand on Lord Susanoo and you'll be sorry, you bald geezer!{????}{スサノオさまに手だしすると承知しないぞこの禿頭じじいめ！}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:11.63,0:46:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! {yabe?}{accurate}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:15.46,0:46:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:18.01,0:46:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, all of you! {maybe only to susanoo and akahana?}{likely all}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:20.40,0:46:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we let him get away with it!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:22.22,0:46:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only follow Lady Amaterasu's orders so far! {pretty accurate - アマテラス様の言いつけでもこれだけはきけません！}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:25.37,0:46:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off! {no violence}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:40.74,0:46:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sister...
Dialogue: 10,0:46:44.70,0:46:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister! Sister!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:08.02,0:47:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:09.73,0:47:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is going to be plunged into darkness!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:38.34,0:47:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If this continues, evil will spread throughout the world.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:45.63,0:47:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We must do something.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:48.41,0:47:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:50.94,0:47:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no choice but to use
Dialogue: 10,0:47:54.69,0:47:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of trick. {/plot}
Dialogue: 10,0:47:58.11,0:48:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! There's a good way.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:05.20,0:48:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... let's begin!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:36.40,0:48:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Tajikara. {not some documented character so not sure}{likely based from Ame-no-Tajikarao, who has practically the same role as Tajikara here}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:39.65,0:48:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:41.67,0:48:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If she opens that stone door even a little...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:46.74,0:48:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:48.63,0:48:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump to your feet and force it open!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:16.51,0:52:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:28.59,0:52:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Tajikara, wake up! \NWon't you wake up?!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:35.88,0:52:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:43.77,0:52:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Omoikane, what is all that merry commotion about? {オモイカネ}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:48.04,0:52:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pitch black outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:50.71,0:52:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, another noble person \Nhas come to take your place, Lady Amaterasu.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:58.81,0:53:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this person!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:04.84,0:53:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:11.80,0:53:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell's bells! {??}{good enough - こりゃいかん！- something like 'not good!'}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:13.65,0:53:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tajikara, hold on tight!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:15.88,0:53:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The stone door opened!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:16.32,0:53:18.30,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Put your back into it! {?????}{didn't quite catch it, but nuance wise should be good}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:17.17,0:53:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:20.11,0:53:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho! Keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:22.74,0:53:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With all our might! Let's do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:31.03,0:53:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's dangerous! {sore abunai???}{maybe, i'd say good enough}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:32.46,0:53:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:33.80,0:53:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, dammit! \NThat's my beard! My beard!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:37.67,0:53:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go! It hurts, dammit!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:45.35,0:53:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:46.17,0:53:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tajikara!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:46.89,0:53:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:52.47,0:53:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:12.61,0:54:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo, that is our collective decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:16.75,0:54:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You must leave the Plain of the High Heaven.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:22.41,0:54:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:28.37,0:54:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo, I don't necessarily think \Nyou did something wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:36.76,0:54:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But... it's true that your actions \Nresulted in irreparable damage.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:42.22,0:54:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:45.24,0:54:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a rough personality, \Nbut you have an honest and kind heart.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:50.35,0:54:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:53.07,0:54:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:54.06,0:54:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose confidence. \NKeep searching for what you seek.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:59.66,0:55:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, you may encounter a terrifying enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:04.71,0:55:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A terrifying enemy?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:06.07,0:55:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. But don't be discouraged.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:10.52,0:55:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight that enemy bravely
Dialogue: 10,0:55:12.85,0:55:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and save the people who are suffering.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:17.21,0:55:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:18.71,0:55:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you will surely be able to find Mother's land of happiness.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:24.20,0:55:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand, sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:31.48,0:55:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let anything get the better of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:34.46,0:55:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo, go with courage. {/be well}
Dialogue: 10,0:55:46.75,0:55:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:23.46,0:56:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little mouse, about to drown!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:39.80,0:56:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:56:41.46,0:56:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:57:02.27,0:57:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:06.28,0:57:08.22,Thought,,0,0,0,,She looks just like Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:16.38,0:57:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But... why did you come to such a lonely place?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:26.40,0:57:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! I'm looking for Mom's land.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:29.52,0:57:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's land?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:30.90,0:57:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:34.69,0:57:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:37.31,0:57:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Izumo Province. {In Japanese mythology, the entrance to Yomi, the land of the dead, was located in this province and was sealed by the god Izanagi by placing a large boulder over it. - so it's not some kind of heaven but an actual province of japan}
Dialogue: 10,0:57:47.11,0:57:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your house near here?
Dialogue: 10,0:57:49.57,0:57:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's upstream of this river.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:58.83,0:58:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:01.01,0:58:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:06.44,0:58:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamata no Orochi?{Yamata no Orochi?}{八岐大蛇 = eight branches big serpent - revert to "Yamata no Orochi" if you think this sounds silly}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:08.88,0:58:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an enormous serpent with eight heads.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:13.27,0:58:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year when the river turn red, that serpent\N comes to take away one of our daughters. {fixed : kawa 川 river, not leaves}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:24.03,0:58:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:25.40,0:58:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:27.24,0:58:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven girls have already been taken, \Nand now only this Princess Kushinada remains. {クシナダ姫}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:39.12,0:58:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 10,0:58:40.66,0:58:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight Yamata no Orochi. {not consistent if you're going with eight-forked}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:46.00,0:58:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a snake. Don't worry. {?? sounds like some proverb but I'm not finding anything, so he probs just compares susanoo to a hawk, a natural enemy of the snake (orochi)}{たかが～ is just an adverb to downplay things, so in this case 'it's just a snake'}
Dialogue: 10,0:58:54.49,0:58:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have three days left \Nuntil Yamata no Orochi comes.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:59.10,0:59:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Titanbo, do you have any good ideas?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:02.19,0:59:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He has eight heads. I don't know...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:06.29,0:59:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:15.41,0:59:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my son earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:22.56,0:59:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo, regarding Yamata no Orochi...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:27.95,0:59:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you had a good idea?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:29.62,0:59:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Since it's such a huge serpent,
Dialogue: 10,0:59:34.81,0:59:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,its heads are way up high, {/necks}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:38.47,0:59:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,so you also have to fly to fight it, \Nor you'll have no chance of winning.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:43.68,0:59:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly to fight it, you say?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:45.61,0:59:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the Swift Heavenly Horse. {天早駒（アメノハヤコマ）/ Ame no haya koma - seems like they invented this one for this movie so it doesn't have any existing translations}{given the later revelation, probably have some base on the flayed horse, the Ama-no-Fuchikoma, but otherwise an original setting}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:49.38,0:59:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,About five ri{/miles} east of here, \Nthere's a Sacred Horse Pond. {/pond called Shinmeike}{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shinme + ike (= pond)}
Dialogue: 10,0:59:56.35,1:00:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At night, a horse called the Swift Heavenly Horse \Nthat flies through the sky comes to that pond to drink water.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:06.09,1:00:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:08.01,1:00:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You have to hide to catch it!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:11.13,1:00:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, quiet.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:40.41,1:00:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:45.25,1:00:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There! Catch him!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:54.39,1:00:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't run! Wait! Wait just a minute!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:58.22,1:01:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:02.10,1:01:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of heights! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:25.37,1:01:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Susanoo.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:48.36,1:01:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo,
Dialogue: 10,1:01:49.94,1:01:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tonight is the night.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:51.32,1:01:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slay Yamata no Orochi!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:56.56,1:01:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:58.53,1:01:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:00.56,1:02:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll definitely defeat it.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:07.18,1:02:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is alike...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:08.76,1:02:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:09.75,1:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face.  You look totally like my mom.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:13.08,1:02:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:17.24,1:02:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo, do you like your mother?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:19.59,1:02:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I love her!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:21.89,1:02:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:24.85,1:02:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll definitely
Dialogue: 10,1:02:26.43,1:02:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,defeat Yamata no Orochi.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:12.77,1:03:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That Yamata no Orochi \Nsure knows how to drink. {likes to drink sake}
Dialogue: 10,1:03:18.15,1:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll defeat him while he's drunk.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:21.87,1:03:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Oops... That was close.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:26.30,1:03:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:28.67,1:03:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm a little hungry today. \NI should be careful not to trip...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:41.15,1:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatcha doin', Titanbo?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:47.68,1:03:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just you watch, governor.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:51.17,1:03:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right... there!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:53.28,1:03:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe like this... {mostly just random rambling as he tries to properly wear the headband}
Dialogue: 10,1:03:56.06,1:03:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And... there!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:57.78,1:04:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear... It's because I have such long ears. \NWhat inconvenient ears.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:31.03,1:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell! Titanbo, are you scared?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:35.02,1:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a little.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:38.32,1:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:40.40,1:04:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Scaredy-cat!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:42.40,1:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No guts!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:49.66,1:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:58.60,1:08:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It started drinking...
Dialogue: 10,1:08:48.82,1:08:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He looked this way...
Dialogue: 10,1:09:00.45,1:09:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:57.76,1:10:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Swift Heavenly Horse!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:01.35,1:10:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:49.15,1:10:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One down, seven to go...
Dialogue: 10,1:10:55.69,1:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here... Grab it!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:19.15,1:12:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two down, six to go!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:41.23,1:13:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, I'll help you now!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:44.82,1:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:47.65,1:13:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{??}{feels just like rambling}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:49.65,1:13:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a klutz after all! {/slowpoke - someone who messes up/takes his time}
Dialogue: 10,1:13:53.47,1:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If only my stomach wasn't empty...
Dialogue: 10,1:14:05.84,1:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it already, you nincompoop!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:24.44,1:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What just happened?{ああ、これは一体何だ}
Dialogue: 10,1:14:33.86,1:14:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts, it hurts.
Dialogue: 10,1:14:36.06,1:14:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Three down, five to go!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:39.92,1:14:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:06.33,1:16:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Four down, four to go!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:09.77,1:17:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Five down, three to go!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:10.29,1:17:12.21,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Five down!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:14.76,1:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:48.06,1:17:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Six!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:50.61,1:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And seven!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:08.87,1:18:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it! Only one more to go!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:14.18,1:20:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:16.70,1:20:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:19.09,1:20:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:20.72,1:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... where'd he go?
Dialogue: 10,1:20:24.01,1:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:26.60,1:20:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:29.10,1:20:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:34.36,1:20:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:36.23,1:20:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 10,1:20:44.74,1:20:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated it.
Dialogue: 10,1:20:54.17,1:20:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's leaving.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:03.80,1:21:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Susanoo...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:05.77,1:21:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, mouse?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:07.55,1:21:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:10.48,1:21:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,that Swift Heavenly Horse actually belongs \Nto the Plain of the High Heaven. {horse from takamagara (amaterasu's realm)}
Dialogue: 10,1:21:16.75,1:21:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Plain of the High Heaven?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:18.27,1:21:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:19.77,1:21:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Amaterasu ordered it to come here.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:23.57,1:21:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But she also ordered me not to tell you anything.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:29.20,1:21:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:31.54,1:21:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what it was.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:36.67,1:21:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sister.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:41.80,1:21:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be discouraged. Fight that enemy bravely \Nand save the people who are suffering. {55:06}
Dialogue: 10,1:21:49.89,1:21:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, you will surely be able
Dialogue: 10,1:21:53.01,1:21:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to find Mother's land of happiness.
Dialogue: 10,1:22:12.03,1:22:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Susanoo!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:14.49,1:22:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Look, look!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:00.18,1:24:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Mom!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:03.40,1:24:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Susanoo. Mom was with you the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:12.49,1:24:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With me?
Dialogue: 10,1:24:13.47,1:24:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:15.08,1:24:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always with you, inside your heart.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:18.41,1:24:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about your land? {meaning "aren't you in the land that you described before"}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:20.98,1:24:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The peaceful, tranquil, and beautiful \Nland of happiness, a bountiful land.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:31.37,1:24:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it! So {\i1}this{\i0} is Mom's land?{this place where they are now}
Dialogue: 10,1:24:34.67,1:24:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:37.56,1:24:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Work together in harmony \Nand build a wonderful country, okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:24:42.85,1:24:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:44.50,1:24:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Live happily forever.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:48.27,1:24:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I understand, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:52.86,1:24:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. \NI'm not going anywhere anymore.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:56.67,1:25:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to clear this land \Nand build a wonderful country!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:00.64,1:25:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help too.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:02.20,1:25:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:03.57,1:25:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So will I.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:05.35,1:25:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make do without you!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:07.05,1:25:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I will.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:12.21,1:25:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. We'll all do it together. \NWe'll call the people from the Land of Fire here too.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:20.66,1:25:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:23.79,1:25:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.87,0:06:17.36,Song,,0,0,0,,{母のない子の子守唄 by 伊福部 昭; full lyrics from dopa's booklet pics: 遠いお空に母さんねむる\N夕やけの雲 あかねいろ\N坊やの夢はお空にのぼる\Nねんねんころりねんねんねん\N遠いお空に母さんねむる\N泣いた坊やは一人ぼっち\N涙のはしに母さんの\Nねんねんころりねんねんねん\N遠いお空に母さんねむる\N坊やの夢は にじの橋\N大きな望み お空にのぼる\Nねんねんころりねんねんねん}Mother sleeps in the distant sky
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.36,0:06:31.22,Song,,0,0,0,,The sunset clouds are crimson
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.22,0:06:45.09,Song,,0,0,0,,The little boy's dreams float up to the sky
Dialogue: 5,0:06:45.09,0:07:00.12,Song,,0,0,0,,Hush my little baby, sleep tight {"nennen korori" is the classic Japanese lullaby refrain (like "hush-a-bye")}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.59,0:08:14.14,Song,,0,0,0,,Izanami{susanoo's mother} has passed away{okakure ni natta - archaic, rare language;  Izanami died giving birth to the child Kagu-tsuchi ("incarnation of fire") or Ho-Musubi ("causer of fire").[12] She was then buried on Mt. Hiba, at the border of the old provinces of Izumo and Hōki, near modern-day Yasugi of Shimane Prefecture. Izanagi was so angry at the death of his wife that he killed the newborn child, thereby creating dozens of deities.}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.14,0:08:21.41,Song,,0,0,0,,Passed away...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:48.82,0:12:09.30,Song,,0,0,0,,{Next verse of the same song}Mother sleeps in the distant sky
Dialogue: 5,0:12:09.30,0:12:29.18,Song,,0,0,0,,The crying little boy is all alone
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.18,0:12:48.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Mommy is at the edge of his tears
Dialogue: 5,1:22:08.11,1:22:24.31,Song,,0,0,0,,Mother sleeps in the distant sky
Dialogue: 5,1:22:24.32,1:22:37.89,Song,,0,0,0,,The little boy dreams of a rainbow bridge
Dialogue: 5,1:22:38.44,1:22:51.74,Song,,0,0,0,,A great hope rises up to the sky
Dialogue: 5,1:22:52.33,1:23:06.80,Song,,0,0,0,,Hush my little baby, sleep tight {"nennen korori" is the classic Japanese lullaby refrain (like "hush-a-bye")}
